WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:17.195
moved closer to the Sovereign's Staff for a better look.

2
00:00:17.776 --> 00:00:21.259
He was trying to remember everything he'd read about the notorious relic.

3
00:00:21.959 --> 00:00:27.844
"Maybe this staff is the real thing, or maybe it's not," he said thoughtfully.

4
00:00:27.864 --> 00:00:32.268
"It was lost so long ago that nobody knows exactly what it looks like.

5
00:00:33.064 --> 00:00:38.726
I mean, it would be exciting to discover an important relic, but most experts think the Sovereign's Staff

6
00:00:38.766 --> 00:00:43.108
was taken to another world, maybe Fardark or He paused.

7
00:00:43.128 --> 00:00:51.392
"Narakan." Based on what Raff had read, Fardark was scary, but Narakan was worse.

8
00:00:52.392 --> 00:00:56.514
It was the terrifying world where the Beast of the Otherworld was from.

9
00:00:56.534 --> 00:01:01.396
"Whatever it is, it's giving off a lot of chaotic magic energy."

10
00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:02.821
Loro backed away.

11
00:01:02.841 --> 00:01:04.662
"Can you feel it?"

12
00:01:04.682 --> 00:01:07.203
"Yes," Raff said.

13
00:01:07.223 --> 00:01:09.124
"We should leave it alone.

14
00:01:10.085 --> 00:01:11.746
Come on, let's get out of this room."

15
00:01:12.926 --> 00:01:14.787
He and Loro took a few steps away.

16
00:01:15.628 --> 00:01:18.930
But Zella stayed where she was, staring at the staff.

17
00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:22.512
"Nobody knows what happened to the Sovereign's Staff.

18
00:01:23.472 --> 00:01:25.033
We should tell someone about this.

19
00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:29.736
Even if it's not that relic, it could be a different one, just as important."

20
00:01:30.524 --> 00:01:34.167
Raff wasn't surprised that Zella was excited about their discovery.

21
00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:36.908
She was always looking for adventures.

22
00:01:36.928 --> 00:01:42.392
"You're not Zann or Perda, and we're not in the Cave of the Unknown," he teased her.

23
00:01:42.412 --> 00:01:44.494
"This thing is probably nothing."

24
00:01:44.994 --> 00:01:47.736
"Yeah, it's probably nothing," Loro said quickly.

25
00:01:48.876 --> 00:01:49.617
Zella shrugged.

26
00:01:49.637 --> 00:01:52.639
"Well, I'm going to contact Zann again.

27
00:01:53.319 --> 00:01:55.421
His parents will want to make sure it's not dangerous."

28
00:01:56.141 --> 00:01:57.162
Her eyes lit up.

29
00:01:58.023 --> 00:01:59.724
"Maybe I can send him a video message!

30
00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:02.333
Perda figured out how to do that, remember?"

31
00:02:02.353 --> 00:02:06.195
"Like I said, you're not Perda," Raff said.

32
00:02:06.215 --> 00:02:08.076
"Do you even know how?"

33
00:02:08.096 --> 00:02:10.558
"I think so," Zella said.

34
00:02:10.578 --> 00:02:14.120
"Perda wants everyone to be able to use new forms of magic.

35
00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:18.242
I saw her talking about video messages on a Newsblink a few weeks ago."

36
00:02:18.982 --> 00:02:23.164
Every night after dinner, Zella and their parents watched the latest Newsblink.

37
00:02:24.145 --> 00:02:29.328
It was a magical video showing interesting stories and images from all over Magica.

38
00:02:30.124 --> 00:02:31.745
Sometimes Raff watched too.

39
00:02:32.345 --> 00:02:34.507
But usually he went to his room to read.

40
00:02:35.127 --> 00:02:38.709
They hurried back outside, and Zella summoned a spy fly.

41
00:02:39.389 --> 00:02:41.550
She rubbed her free hand against her leg.

42
00:02:42.071 --> 00:02:45.032
Then she touched the spy fly and set it on a branch.

43
00:02:45.052 --> 00:02:48.154
"Spy on us," Zella said.

44
00:02:48.894 --> 00:02:49.775
She looked at the others.

45
00:02:50.475 --> 00:02:51.996
"Okay, now we just talk to them.

46
00:02:52.796 --> 00:02:53.357
Let's try it."

47
00:02:54.037 --> 00:02:55.298
Loro looked interested.

48
00:02:55.318 --> 00:02:58.059
"You should do the talking, Zella."

49
00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:02.590
"Okay." She took a deep breath and looked at the spy fly.

50
00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:03.630
"Hi, Zann.

51
00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:04.811
It's Zella again.

52
00:03:05.531 --> 00:03:06.992
I hope you got my message yesterday."

53
00:03:07.532 --> 00:03:12.215
She went on to tell Zann about the jeweled staff they'd found inside the cave.

54
00:03:12.975 --> 00:03:15.597
Then she sent the spy fly off to find him.

55
00:03:15.617 --> 00:03:17.598
"There," she said.

56
00:03:17.618 --> 00:03:19.238
"I hope it works."

57
00:03:20.179 --> 00:03:20.919
Raff nodded.

58
00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.461
He couldn't make up his mind about their discovery.

59
00:03:24.481 --> 00:03:28.223
"It's probably not the Sovereign's Staff," he thought.

60
00:03:29.452 --> 00:03:30.753
"But what if it is?

61
00:03:32.014 --> 00:03:32.695
Loro's right.

62
00:03:32.955 --> 00:03:34.096
It could be very dangerous."

63
00:03:34.936 --> 00:03:37.839
"We shouldn't leave that staff unguarded," Loro said.

64
00:03:37.859 --> 00:03:40.241
"What if someone else stumbles across it?

65
00:03:41.001 --> 00:03:43.143
They might think it's valuable and take it."

66
00:03:43.163 --> 00:03:46.446
"Nobody ever comes out here," Zella said.

67
00:03:46.466 --> 00:03:51.190
"Still, we should tell the mayor about it," Raff said.

68
00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:55.013
"She can put a Shield spell on the cave to keep people out."

69
00:03:55.753 --> 00:03:58.696
"Why don't you two go and find her," Loro said.

70
00:03:59.392 --> 00:04:01.893
"I'll stay here and guard the cave entrance."

71
00:04:01.913 --> 00:04:03.734
"Are you sure?"

72
00:04:04.154 --> 00:04:04.634
Raff said.

73
00:04:04.654 --> 00:04:06.715
"I could stay with you."

74
00:04:07.575 --> 00:04:08.756
Loro shook his head.

75
00:04:08.776 --> 00:04:10.277
"I'll be fine.

76
00:04:11.137 --> 00:04:13.758
It's not dangerous if I stay out here, right?"

77
00:04:14.578 --> 00:04:15.139
He grinned.

78
00:04:15.159 --> 00:04:19.240
"Besides, you should be there when your sister tells the adults.

79
00:04:20.081 --> 00:04:25.263
I mean, I only just met her, and I already know she's always looking for adventure.

80
00:04:26.223 --> 00:04:27.944
What if nobody believes her?"

81
00:04:28.836 --> 00:04:30.357
Zella smiled ruefully.

82
00:04:30.377 --> 00:04:33.840
"The mayor still teases me about that funny-looking rock.

83
00:04:34.641 --> 00:04:37.263
I thought it was from another world and made a big fuss.

84
00:04:38.024 --> 00:04:38.584
Come on, Raff.

85
00:04:38.924 --> 00:04:39.365
Let's go!"

86
00:04:40.065 --> 00:04:44.048
Leaving Loro in the clearing, Raff and Zella zapped back to the village.

87
00:04:44.909 --> 00:04:47.071
Mayor Ruxton was watering her shrubs.

88
00:04:48.012 --> 00:04:51.114
She looked skeptical when Zella told her about the staff.

89
00:04:52.055 --> 00:04:55.838
Then Raff described the power he'd felt emanating from it.

90
00:04:55.858 --> 00:04:58.320
"Hmm, that's odd.

91
00:04:58.964 --> 00:05:01.286
I'd better get some people to take a look," she said.

92
00:05:01.306 --> 00:05:02.627
"Just in case."

93
00:05:03.268 --> 00:05:09.173
Soon a small group, including Raff's parents, the mayor, and some other adults, was walking back to the

94
00:05:09.213 --> 00:05:14.957
cave. Old Panno heard what they were talking about and limped along at the back of the group.

95
00:05:15.738 --> 00:05:18.560
When they reached the cave, Loro rushed to meet them.

96
00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:22.023
"I heard noises from inside while you were gone!

97
00:05:22.724 --> 00:05:25.446
There was a weird wave of magic energy too."

98
00:05:25.466 --> 00:05:27.768
"Are you all right?"

99
00:05:28.264 --> 00:05:30.585
Raff's mother asked Loro, and he nodded.

100
00:05:31.266 --> 00:05:33.467
Mayor Ruxton performed a Testing spell.

101
00:05:33.487 --> 00:05:36.369
"I don't sense any stray energy right now.

102
00:05:37.189 --> 00:05:38.270
I think it's safe to go in."

103
00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:40.411
She pointed at the three kids.

104
00:05:40.431 --> 00:05:43.592
"Please show me where you saw this mysterious staff."

105
00:05:44.773 --> 00:05:48.015
Raff, Zella, and Loro led the adults into the cave.

106
00:05:48.755 --> 00:05:53.298
The adults gasped in surprise over the crown and the other items in the large room.

107
00:05:54.318 --> 00:05:57.200
Then they reached the room at the end of the steep tunnel.

108
00:05:58.128 --> 00:06:00.870
This time it was the kids who gasped in shock.

109
00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.731
"Oh, no," Zella said.

110
00:06:03.751 --> 00:06:05.712
"It was right over there!"

111
00:06:06.533 --> 00:06:09.214
Raff stared at the spot where the staff had leaned.

112
00:06:09.835 --> 00:06:14.357
He could see its faint outline in the dust, but the staff itself was gone.

113
00:06:14.937 --> 00:06:15.858
The mayor frowned.

114
00:06:15.878 --> 00:06:18.579
"Are you sure this is the right chamber, kids?"

115
00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.380
she asked.

116
00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:21.121
Raff gulped.

117
00:06:23.002 --> 00:06:24.523
"Yes, we're sure.

118
00:06:25.263 --> 00:06:27.744
Whatever that thing was, it's gone!"
